      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxq4bhezas2q",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "GPT-4 was the undisputed best model in the world for a full year and we all debated whether anyone could catch up or if OpenAI had some secret formula that nobody else knew about.\n\nNow there are are 19 AI models that can run on a modern smartphone that are better than GPT-4!",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxq4bhezas2q",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-13T03:39:12.245Z",
      "likes": 184,
      "replies": 7,
      "reposts": 28,
      "score": 7.4,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.4,
        "recency": 0.9,
        "age_hours": 14.8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxoxbpm5nk2z",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "If you haven’t made sure to turn on two-factor authentication on all accounts, have passwords with family in case you get voice calls asking for money, etc, now would be a good time.\n\nAI gains mean the costs of mass targeting individuals with very sophisticated attacks are dropping.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3mxoxbpm5nk2z",
      "posted_at": "2026-10-12T16:37:12.421Z",
      "likes": 119,
      "replies": 8,
      "reposts": 26,
      "score": 7,
      "score_parts": {
