      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "This is the most comprehensive description yet of how a model can “escape”. Out requires a few assumptions, like a worm that is exploiting vulnerable IOT hardware or unmonitored servers www.anthropic.com/research/sel...\n\nNot impossible. Not likely.",
